 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Sound of the letter G",
   "texto": [
    "In front of **a, o, u**, the «g» sounds hard / g /: **gara**, **gusto**.",
    "In front of **e, i**, the «g» sounds sweet / dħ/ (like a «and» or the English «j» of * jump *): **gelato**, **giorno**, **Gina**.",
    "To keep the sound hard before e, i, a mute «h» is interspersed: **margherita**, **spaghetti**, **colleghi**.",
    "In the **gia**, **gio**, **giu** groups, the «i» is not pronounced as an independent vocal: it is used to indicate the sweet sound. That's why **giovedì** sounds «yovedí»."
   ]
  },
